Interpretation tips:
  dir_acc         → among gated trades with true up/down, fraction correct
  edge            → dir_acc - 0.5 (positive = better than coin flip)
  coverage        → fraction of bars that would trade
  * marker        → serve GATE_THRESHOLD=0.4
  gated_acc       → also counts true-flat as miss (stricter than dir_acc)
  fixed-coverage  → edge at top-x% confidence; comparable across models
  wilson_lb       → conservative lower bound on dir_acc (small n → low)
